WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:06.450
Zizi: Welcome to our town! The big street festival is on Saturday.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Ada: Everyone needs help to get ready. Let's go!

3
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.567
Pick a friend.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.348
Count at the market.

5
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.450
Uncle Femi: Tap each teddy to wake it up. Count as you go.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.468
Grow things on the farm.

7
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.050
Gran: Ahh, a nice drink. Look, it's standing up!

8
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.613
Code a robot.

9
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.490
Ngozi: Bolt got the battery! Great code!

10
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:32.450
Zizi: Woo-hoo!

11
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.988
Find out what floats.

12
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.420
Bayo: The cork floats! It stays on top.

13
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.698
And make the cloth.

14
00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:46.050
Ada: Circle, star. Circle, star. What comes next?

15
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.996
It runs in the browser, on the screens you already have.

16
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:02.300
A wrong tap gets a hint, not a buzzer. So they try again.

17
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:03.150
Zizi: Woo-hoo!

18
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.000
Ada: Everything is ready!

19
00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:08.150
Ada: Happy festival, everyone!

20
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:13.700
Festival Town. A whole world of learning. Ready to play.
